  "title": "2021 ENERGY STAR Sustained Excellence Award",
  "summary": "BOSTON–(BUSINESS WIRE)–Apr. 13, 2021– Boston Properties, Inc. (NYSE: BXP), the largest publicly traded developer, owner, and manager of Class A office properties in the United States, today announced that it has received the 2021 ENERGY STAR Partner of the Year—Sustained Excellence Award from the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency and the U.S. Department of Energy. The Sustained Excellence award is the highest […]",
